<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink195-kilavi">
       varaiviṭaivaittup poruḷvayiṟpirinta talaimakaṉ taṉittuṟaiya āṟṟāṉāyc colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
       Spoken by the hero - as one who could not bear it, being alone - who had separated for the sake of wealth, [thus] putting a hold on marriage.</p>
  </div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink195">
<l>vaḷaipaṭu muttam paratavar pakaruṅ</l>
<l>kaṭalkeḻu koṇkaṉ kātaṉ maṭamakaḷ</l>
<l>keṭalaruṅ tuyara nalkip</l>
<l>paṭaliṉ pāyal vauvi yōḷe</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>The loving, innocent girl of the man from the sea [with] the ocean</l>
          <l>Where fishermen sell pearls inside conches to be set into bangles,</l>
          <l>Has snatched [away his] pleasant bed for lying down [=sleep],</l>
          <l>Having granted [him] grief that is difficult to be rid of.</l>
                </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
